ncy and confidence in clinical settings.\n\nVS-Management has been reviewed by medical experts and developed in accordance with the latest medical education standards, ensuring a reliable and effective learning environment. \n\nThis VR simulator offers an immersive experience for mastering ventilator procedures and alarm management.", "short_description": "VS-Management is a VR-based ventilator simulator designed for users to train ventilator operation and learn three key alarm management procedures."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "015.VS_M_Back.png", "id": "1690717328178195", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394271_1690717331511528_6387639417886293840_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fijp0JnqHw8Q7kNvwEEhYMJ&_nc_oc=Adpfk6f5oIEM6xdS6IY6Xo10wotwDMUZ3ADq2FfXU5EroKiO-EI1rx6n2KNuEhkDMKg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQToBeIe-vAvdP0NGAiHbe-3OcvqijkPTo2gR9ErD5WmFA&oe=6AEB33B9"}, {"file_name": "014.VS_M.png", "id": "1624805861475462", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394167_1624805864808795_4742067852837435819_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fRQvRQPTmBkQ7kNvwHjweOU&_nc_oc=Adr5Q8r_iBHjX6P_DlZ0vAdOg9hMic4zGnM5aDFdbJh4A5H29sL04w_sCPweRpXJZzs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQztXytFC74oNHNLsVvGZdK3x-Iw1l_EGoZTVd75C-ZHg&oe=6AEB5A4F"}, {"file_name": "006.VS_M_Portrait.png", "id": "1192361138888724", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400716_1192361142222057_7581507312873433284_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JuQoIXLrhLAQ7kNvwHf3c1L&_nc_oc=AdpqrGNmONd2qO8m3HsCSvuzZTvLywU4MvhKwvlMMaHF2SycS0T21IKYQ2VLMtp9EJU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQUQ6Kd_xD4AXbR3XPm6IsvUrdQAqV6l7Xwq5ehVJDbhw&oe=6AEB2FEE"}, {"file_name": "005.VS_M_Squar